---
description: UI8Kit 3 primitives in codegen-x (packages/kit/*)
alwaysApply: true
---

- Primitives (19 + slot) live in `packages/kit/<runtime>`, installed by the CLI `ui8kit` 3.x from `@ui8kit/registry` 3.x. Never edit or copy them by hand; refresh with `bunx ui8kit@3 add --all --force` in that folder and keep `bun run kit:check` green.
- API of a primitive: ui8kit/codegen `docs/primitives/<name>.md`. Do not invent props; v3 primitives ship no visual classes, style with token classes through `class` / `className`.
- Grid 8 + 4 without half steps: spacing on the 8px grid (Tailwind 2, 4, 6, 8, ...); the 4px step (1, 3, 5, ... e.g. `px-3`, `py-1`) is allowed **only inside controls** (button, input, select, textarea, checkbox, radio, switch, badge, icon badge: `CONTROL_RECIPES` in packages/kit-compose/src/map.ts), enforced by the kit-compose tests. Colors only through tokens, icons only Lucide.
- The composition layer (organisms, blocks, screens, host apps) is generated by `packages/compose-gen` onto `packages/kit-compose`; xgen is removed (tag `xgen-archive-2026-10-24`), and `bun run check` (xgen-exit-guard) fails on any path back into it.
- Former bricks (Stack, Group, Title, Card, Badge, Table, ...) are compositions in `packages/kit-compose`: edit `src/map.ts` or `variants/*.json`, then `bun run compose:build`; never edit `packages/kit-compose/<runtime>/src/compose` by hand.
- No raw HTML tag where a primitive exists (`bun run gates:source`); Box/Text `tag` only from the HTML5 allowlist.
